{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/oauth2\/par"},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §26.1) — push the authorization request over the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"back channel and get an opaque handle to redirect with."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/oidcpar(request:redirecturi:scope:tenantid:configuration:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"oidcPar"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20AuthorizationRequestV","text":"AuthorizationRequest","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthorizationRequest"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"redirectURI"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scope"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" = \"openid profile email\", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","text":"OidcConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK26PushedAuthorizationRequestV","text":"PushedAuthorizationRequest","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PushedAuthorizationRequest"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/oidcBegin(redirectURI:scope:configuration:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returned. Its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nonce"},{"type":"text","text":" and PKCE verifier are pushed as-is — §26.2 rule 1 forbids a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second generator."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"request"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the same redirect URI that will be sent at exchange time."}]}],"name":"redirectURI"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the requested scope. Must match what was pushed at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oidcBegin"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"scope"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a tenant override for the "},{"code":"?tenant_id=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" query parameter."}]}],"name":"tenantID"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the discovery document, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" to discover.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"configuration"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PAR moves the authorization request off the browser. Instead of putting "},{"code":"scope","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"redirect_uri","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and the PKCE challenge into a URL the user agent carries,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the client POSTs them straight to AXIAM over an authenticated channel and puts an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opaque "},{"code":"request_uri","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the redirect. What travels through the browser is then a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"random string that cannot be edited into meaning something else."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Required for a FAPI 2.0 client","type":"text"}]},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"profile: \"fapi2\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" refuses a registration that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not set ","type":"text"},{"code":"require_par","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so such a client cannot authorize any other way (§21.1).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not retried on a "},{"code":"5xx","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or a transport failure — it is a POST that creates server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state, so it falls outside §16.2’s read-only eligibility exactly as "},{"code":"oidcExchange","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does. The safe recovery is a fresh push, which costs one round trip and cannot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"double-consume anything (§26.2 rule 4)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)"},{"text":" client-side, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"no wire call","type":"text"}]},{"text":", when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"discovery document advertises no PAR endpoint — §12.7.2 rule 1’s discipline: never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"synthesise the URL from the issuer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"oidcPar"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20AuthorizationRequestV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AuthorizationRequest"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"redirectURI"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scope"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK26PushedAuthorizationRequestV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PushedAuthorizationRequest"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC7oidcPar7request11redirectURI5scope8tenantID13configurationAA26PushedAuthorizationRequestVAA0nO0V_S3SSgAA17OidcConfigurationVSgtYaKF","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"oidcPar(request:redirectURI:scope:tenantID:configuration:)","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method